# Frontend standards

- Functional React components + TypeScript
- Brand **Gameplan** as a hero-level signal on marketing/league hub surfaces
- One job per section; avoid card-heavy dashboards unless cards wrap interactions
- Prefer expressive typography; avoid generic Inter/Roboto-only SaaS look
- Use CSS variables for the visual system; avoid purple-on-white AI-default themes
- Motion: intentional, few, hierarchy-supporting
- Charts only when they clarify comparison/analysis (not decoration)
- Mobile and desktop must both work for league and match views
